[{"answer":"I thought that movie was terrific, didn't you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/82-an-interesting-movie-2022-03-07-21-31-24/1.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't know. It didn't seem to have any meaning.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/82-an-interesting-movie-2022-03-07-21-31-24/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Come on. It seems that you expect intellectual stimulation from every movie.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/82-an-interesting-movie-2022-03-07-21-31-24/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I just think that a good movie should have a central theme at least.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/82-an-interesting-movie-2022-03-07-21-31-24/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. But it doesn't hurt you to watch a funny movie once in a while.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/82-an-interesting-movie-2022-03-07-21-31-24/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Relax and enjoy it!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/82-an-interesting-movie-2022-03-07-21-31-24/6.mp3"},{"answer":"You're right. I'm too serious sometimes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/english-conversations/82-an-interesting-movie-2022-03-07-21-31-24/7.mp3"}]
